        "retweet": null,
        "quoted": {
          "id": "2095472621190066233",
          "text": "A map of the peak birth years of each country and their decline since then. Produced with Wikipedia articles, a calculator, and a lot of autism.\n\nWe live well into the age of demographic decline.\n\n@MoreBirths @BirthGauge @Smirkley @lymanstoneky @SimoneHCollins https://t.co/xB0lhvGu9c",
