    {
      "id": "2095720611695759704",
      "text": "The Cybercab motor uses no rare earth metals, but maintains the same range! \n\nThis was extremely hard to achieve.",
      "created_at": "Fri Sep 04 03:48:25 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2095686122194055221",
        "text": "The Cybercab drive unit features a simplified bar-wound stator and lubrication system, plus an overall architecture that enables fully automated, sub-10-second cycle times.\n\nIt is 18% smaller, 25% lighter and more efficient than other top performing electric vehicle drive units. https://t.co/lZXJ8RNT1I",
        "created_at": "Fri Sep 04 01:31:22 +0000 2026",
        "lang": "en",
        "media": [
          {
            "type": "photo",
            "id": "2095686110563229700",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRVfagTXYAQOS7s.jpg"
